# Executable scripts must stay executable, and a shell script must keep LF: a 100644 start script and a CRLF .sh are the two ways a fresh clone breaks silently.
# (Both happened to this repo through a workspace round-trip; `filemode` keeps the bit honest.)
*           text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.bat       text eol=crlf
bin/agency  text eol=lf filemode
*.py        text eol=lf filemode
*.json      text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
